## The finding, reproduced first

```
$ printf 'x   =   5\nsay x\n' > m4.rb && rb format m4.rb
x is 5
say x
$ ls -l m4.rb          # 17 bytes, unchanged
$ cat m4.rb
x   =   5
say x
```

